<title>USA: GTE Corp sells $500 mln of notes.</title>
<headline>GTE Corp sells $500 mln of notes.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following issue from GTE</p>
<p>Corp was priced on Thursday via Salomon Brothers, according to</p>
<p>market sources.</p>
<p>BORROWER GTE CORP</p>
<p>AMT $500 MLN	 COUPON 7.51 PCT   MATURITY 4/1/2009</p>
<p>TYPE NOTES	   ISS PRICE 99.966  FIRST PAY DATE 10/1/1997</p>
<p>LAST MOODY'S A3    YIELD 7.514 PCT   PAY FREQ  SEMI-ANNUAL</p>
<p>LAST S&amp;P SINGLE-A  SPREAD 67 BPS     CALLABLE  NO</p>
<p>((--U.S. Corporate Bond Unit, 212 859-1678))</p>
</text>
